/0

# ── Run outputs and internal validation — never source ──
# The rules above name individual files, which stops working the moment a run is written
# under a new name (`--json fresh_1.json` leaked exactly that way). These are patterns.
#
# Internal validation evidence lives in the PAI repo, not here: it carries transcript
# stores, API-cost figures, and analysis scripts that critique the code.
/validation/
/rel_*/
/home_*/
/*.log
# `proof run --json <name>` outputs. A report is a RESULT of the tool, not part of it.
/fresh_*.json
/fresh_*.md
/local_*.json
/local_*.md
/run_*.json
/run_*.md
# Local Claude Code state (worktrees, launch config) — never ship in an sdist.
/.claude/
